      <field name="description">PrintEs gibt noch einige andere Prints in DICOM.Am wahrscheinlichsten ist hier gemeint:Aus dem Datadictionary von DICOM:UID = Unique Identifier(Seite 80 oben)UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.1.14UID Name:Print Job SOP Class UID Type:SOP Class Part:PS 3.4</field>
    </element>
    <element class="EreignisNachrichtenTyp" hash="ENT_1114178660733_2570">
      <field name="name">DICOM-Query/Retrieve - DICOM-Query/Retrieve</field>
      <field name="description">Query/RetrieveEs gibt noch einige andere Query/Retrieve in DICOM.Die am wahrscheinlichsten hier gemeinten sind:Aus dem Datadictionary von DICOM:UID = Unique Identifier(Seite 83 mitte)UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.1.1UID Name:Patient Root Query/Retrieve Information Model  FINDUID Type:SOP Class Part:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.1.2UID Name:Patient Root Query/Retrieve Information Model  MOVEUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.1.3UID Name:Patient Root Query/Retrieve Information Model  GETUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.2.1UID Name:Study Root Query/Retrieve Information Model  FINDUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.2.2UID Name:Study Root Query/Retrieve Information Model  MOVEUID Type:SOP Class Part:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.2.3UID Name:Study Root Query/Retrieve Information Model GETUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.3.1UDI Name:Patient/Study Only Query/Retrieve Information Model - FINDUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.3.2UID Name:Patient/Study Only Query/Retrieve Information Model - MOVEUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4UID:1.2.840.10008.5.1.4.1.2.3.3UID Name:Patient/Study Only Query/Retrieve Information Model - GETUID Type:SOP ClassPart:PS 3.4</field>
    </element>
